// Réglages Raccourcis (app/src/widgets/shortcuts/Settings.svelte) : liste des raccourcis
// (glisser pour réordonner, choisir, retrait annulable, ajout), et détails du raccourci choisi :
// nom, cible (« Parcourir… »), icône libre — logo Simple Icons cherché par nom avec sa couleur,
// image choisie, ou icône de l'appli. Service : src/ui/widget_settings/shortcuts.rs.

import { Theme } from "../theme.slint";
import { Icon } from "../components.slint";
import { DashedBox } from "../dashed.slint";
import { SettingsLayout } from "../settings/layout.slint";
import { SettingsButton, RemoveButton } from "../settings/button.slint";
import { InputField } from "../settings/input.slint";
import { Tip } from "../tooltip.slint";

// Icône d'un raccourci (lib/ShortcutIcon.svelte) : image, teinte (0 aucune, 1 `tint`, 2 couleur
// du texte), case vide en attendant l'extraction.
export struct ShortcutThumb {
    image: image,
    tint-mode: int,
    tint: color,
    blank: bool,
}

export struct ShortcutRow {
    label: string,
    target: string,
    thumb: ShortcutThumb,
}

export struct BrandChoice {
    slug: string,
    title: string,
    thumb: ShortcutThumb,
}

export global ShortcutsSettingsData {
    in property <[ShortcutRow]> rows;
    in property <int> selected;
    // Raccourci choisi.
    in property <string> label;
    in property <string> target;
    // « simple », « file » ou « exe ».
    in property <string> icon-kind;
    in property <string> icon-path;
    in property <color> color;
    in property <bool> has-color;
    in property <[BrandChoice]> brands;
    in property <string> query;
    in property <string> current-slug;
    callback select(int);
    callback move(int, int);
    callback add();
    callback remove(int);
    callback set-label(string);
    callback set-target(string);
    callback browse-target();
    callback browse-image();
    callback icon(string);
    callback search(string);
    callback brand(string);
    callback pick-color();
    callback brand-color();
}

component Thumb inherits Image {
    in property <ShortcutThumb> thumb;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    source: root.thumb.image;
    image-fit: contain;
    colorize: root.thumb.tint-mode == 2 ? SettingsLayout.t.text : (root.thumb.tint-mode == 1 ? root.thumb.tint : transparent);
}

component Label inherits Text {
    color: SettingsLayout.t.text-dim;
    font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
}

component IconChoice inherits SettingsButton {
    filled: true;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: Theme.r-lg;
}

export component ShortcutsSettings inherits VerticalLayout {
    // Hauteur d'une ligne de la liste et écart (glisser-déposer).
    property <length> row-h: 48px;
    property <length> row-gap: 4px;
    property <int> drag-from: -1;
    property <int> drag-over: -1;
    property <bool> dropped;
    property <bool> has-current: ShortcutsSettingsData.selected >= 0 && ShortcutsSettingsData.selected < ShortcutsSettingsData.rows.length;
    property <length> w: SettingsLayout.content-w;
    // Grille des logos : colonnes d'au moins 38 px, écart 6 px.
    property <int> brand-cols: max(1, floor((root.w - 32px + 6px) / 44px));
    property <length> brand-w: (root.w - 32px - (root.brand-cols - 1) * 6px) / root.brand-cols;
    property <int> brand-rows: ceil(ShortcutsSettingsData.brands.length / root.brand-cols);
    alignment: start;
    spacing: 10px;

    // Liste.
    Rectangle {
        height: max(0px, ShortcutsSettingsData.rows.length * (root.row-h + root.row-gap) - root.row-gap);
        for s[i] in ShortcutsSettingsData.rows: Rectangle {
            y: i * (root.row-h + root.row-gap);
            height: root.row-h;
            border-radius: Theme.r-xl;
            border-width: 1px;
            background: SettingsLayout.t.surface-1;
            border-color: root.drag-from >= 0 && root.drag-over == i && root.drag-from != i ? Theme.accent
                : (i == ShortcutsSettingsData.selected ? Theme.accent.with-alpha(0.6) : transparent);
            row := TouchArea {
                width: parent.width - 34px;
                mouse-cursor: pointer;
                clicked => {
                    // Un glisser-déposer qui se termine ne choisit pas la ligne de départ.
                    if root.drag-from < 0 && !root.dropped {
                        ShortcutsSettingsData.select(i);
                    }
                }
                pointer-event(e) => {
                    if e.kind == PointerEventKind.down {
                        root.dropped = false;
                    } else if e.kind == PointerEventKind.up {
                        if root.drag-from >= 0 {
                            root.dropped = true;
                            if root.drag-over >= 0 && root.drag-over != root.drag-from {
                                ShortcutsSettingsData.move(root.drag-from, root.drag-over);
                            }
                        }
                        root.drag-from = -1;
                        root.drag-over = -1;
                    }
                }
                moved => {
                    if self.pressed && (abs(self.mouse-y - self.pressed-y) > 4px || root.drag-from >= 0) {
                        root.drag-from = i;
                        root.drag-over = clamp(floor((i * (root.row-h + root.row-gap) + self.mouse-y) / (root.row-h + root.row-gap)), 0, ShortcutsSettingsData.rows.length - 1);
                    }
                }
            }
            HorizontalLayout {
                padding-left: 10px;
                padding-right: 6px;
                spacing: 10px;
                Text {
                    text: "⋮⋮";
                    color: SettingsLayout.t.text-dim;
                    letter-spacing: -2px;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    Rectangle {
                        width: 30px;
                        height: 30px;
                        border-radius: Theme.r-lg;
                        background: Theme.field-bg;
                        if !s.thumb.blank: Thumb {
                            thumb: s.thumb;
                        }
                    }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    Text {
                        text: s.label;
                        color: SettingsLayout.t.text;
                        font-weight: 500;
                        overflow: elide;
                    }
                    Text {
                        text: s.target != "" ? s.target : "aucune cible : pas affiché";
                        color: s.target != "" ? SettingsLayout.t.text-dim : SettingsLayout.t.warn;
                        font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
                        overflow: elide;
                    }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    RemoveButton {
                        what: "le raccourci « " + s.label + " »";
                        clicked => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.remove(i);
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // « Ajouter un raccourci » (contour pointillé, accent au survol).
    HorizontalLayout {
        alignment: start;
        Rectangle {
            width: add-row.preferred-width;
            height: 31px;
            DashedBox {
                ink: add.has-hover ? Theme.accent : SettingsLayout.t.surface-2;
                radius: Theme.r-lg;
            }
            add := TouchArea {
                mouse-cursor: pointer;
                clicked => {
                    ShortcutsSettingsData.add();
                }
            }
            add-row := HorizontalLayout {
                padding-left: 12px;
                padding-right: 12px;
                spacing: 6px;
                VerticalLayout {
                    alignment: center;
                    Icon {
                        source: @image-url("../../icons/phosphor/plus.svg");
                        size: 13px;
                        color: SettingsLayout.t.text;
                    }
                }
                Text {
                    text: "Ajouter un raccourci";
                    color: SettingsLayout.t.text;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // Détails du raccourci choisi.
    if root.has-current: Rectangle {
        border-radius: Theme.r-2xl;
        background: SettingsLayout.t.surface-1;
        VerticalLayout {
            padding: 16px;
            padding-top: 16px;
            spacing: 14px;
            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 6px;
                Label {
                    text: "Nom";
                }
                InputField {
                    height: 32px;
                    padding-x: 10px;
                    radius: Theme.r-lg;
                    value: ShortcutsSettingsData.label;
                    edited(t) => {
                        ShortcutsSettingsData.set-label(t);
                    }
                }
            }
            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 6px;
                Label {
                    text: "Cible (fichier, raccourci, dossier ou adresse web)";
                }
                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 6px;
                    InputField {
                        height: 32px;
                        padding-x: 10px;
                        radius: Theme.r-lg;
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                        value: ShortcutsSettingsData.target;
                        placeholder: "https://… ou C:\\…";
                        invalid: ShortcutsSettingsData.target == "";
                        invalid-color: SettingsLayout.t.warn;
                        edited(t) => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.set-target(t);
                        }
                    }
                    IconChoice {
                        text: "Parcourir…";
                        height: 32px;
                        clicked => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.browse-target();
                        }
                    }
                }
                if ShortcutsSettingsData.target == "": Text {
                    width: root.w - 32px;
                    text: "Cible obligatoire : sans elle, le raccourci n’apparaît pas dans la barre.";
                    color: SettingsLayout.t.warn;
                    font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
            }
            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 6px;
                Label {
                    text: "Icône";
                }
                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 4px;
                    alignment: start;
                    IconChoice {
                        text: "Logo";
                        on: ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "simple";
                        clicked => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.icon("simple");
                        }
                    }
                    IconChoice {
                        text: "Image…";
                        on: ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "file";
                        clicked => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.browse-image();
                        }
                    }
                    IconChoice {
                        text: "Icône de l’appli";
                        on: ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "exe";
                        clicked => {
                            ShortcutsSettingsData.icon("exe");
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            if ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "simple": VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 14px;
                InputField {
                    height: 32px;
                    padding-x: 10px;
                    radius: Theme.r-lg;
                    value: ShortcutsSettingsData.query;
                    placeholder: "Chercher un logo (YouTube, Steam, Spotify…)";
                    edited(t) => {
                        ShortcutsSettingsData.search(t);
                    }
                }
                if ShortcutsSettingsData.brands.length == 0: Text {
                    width: root.w - 32px;
                    text: ShortcutsSettingsData.query != "" ? "Aucun logo trouvé." : "Tape un nom de marque pour voir les logos.";
                    color: SettingsLayout.t.text-dim;
                    font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }
                if ShortcutsSettingsData.brands.length > 0: Flickable {
                    height: min(132px, root.brand-rows * 44px - 6px);
                    content-height: root.brand-rows * 44px - 6px;
                    for b[i] in ShortcutsSettingsData.brands: Rectangle {
                        x: Math.mod(i, root.brand-cols) * (root.brand-w + 6px);
                        y: floor(i / root.brand-cols) * 44px;
                        width: root.brand-w;
                        height: 38px;
                        border-radius: Theme.r-lg;
                        border-width: 1px;
                        border-color: b.slug == ShortcutsSettingsData.current-slug || area.has-hover ? Theme.accent : transparent;
                        background: Theme.field-bg;
                        area := TouchArea {
                            mouse-cursor: pointer;
                            changed has-hover => {
                                if self.has-hover {
                                    Tip.show(b.title);
                                } else {
                                    Tip.hide();
                                }
                            }
                            clicked => {
                                ShortcutsSettingsData.brand(b.slug);
                            }
                        }
                        Thumb {
                            thumb: b.thumb;
                        }
                    }
                }
                VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 6px;
                    Label {
                        text: "Couleur";
                    }
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 6px;
                        alignment: start;
                        Rectangle {
                            width: 44px;
                            height: 32px;
                            border-radius: Theme.r-lg;
                            border-width: 1px;
                            border-color: swatch.has-hover ? Theme.accent : SettingsLayout.t.surface-2;
                            background: Theme.field-bg;
                            Rectangle {
                                x: 4px;
                                y: 4px;
                                width: parent.width - 8px;
                                height: parent.height - 8px;
                                border-radius: 3px;
                                background: ShortcutsSettingsData.color;
                            }
                            swatch := TouchArea {
                                mouse-cursor: pointer;
                                clicked => {
                                    ShortcutsSettingsData.pick-color();
                                }
                            }
                        }
                        IconChoice {
                            text: "Couleur de la marque";
                            height: 32px;
                            enabled: ShortcutsSettingsData.has-color;
                            clicked => {
                                ShortcutsSettingsData.brand-color();
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            if ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "file": Text {
                width: root.w - 32px;
                text: ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-path;
                color: SettingsLayout.t.text-dim;
                font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
                wrap: char-wrap;
            }
            if ShortcutsSettingsData.icon-kind == "exe": Text {
                width: root.w - 32px;
                text: "L’icône de la cible est utilisée, sans flèche de raccourci.";
                color: SettingsLayout.t.text-dim;
                font-size: Theme.fs-meta;
                wrap: word-wrap;
            }
        }
    }
}
